    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44470" root="&#xA;                        وجه&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَهَةٌ</span></b> 
                        : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْهٌ</span> throughout. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ جِهَةِ كَذَا</span>
                        <i>In respect of,</i> or <i>with reference to, such a thing:</i>
and <i>by reason,</i> or <i>on account,</i> or <i>because, of
such a thing.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الجِهَاتُ السِّتُ</span>
                        <i>The six relative
points</i> or <i>directions</i> or <i>locations;</i> namely, above,
below, before, behind, right, and left.

